  "name": "Question 8",
  "problem": "Let $D=AB.$ What is the value of ${d}_{24}$, if\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]?\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $2$nd row in $A$ by the $4$th column in $B$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{d}_{24} & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-3)+4\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =-9+4+3 \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
